  "question": {
    "text": "If the mean and variance of five observations are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>24</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>194</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math> respectively and the mean of first four observations is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, then the variance of the first four observations in equal to"
  },
